{"seq":2,"slug":"nlp-clinical-text","title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 临床文本自然语言处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/ai-healthcare/nlp-clinical-text","wordCount":1896,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-生物医学信息学-临床文本自然语言处理\">研究生 生物医学信息学 — 临床文本自然语言处理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>临床文本自然语言处理（Clinical NLP）是从非结构化临床文本——包括入院记录、手术报告、护理文书、放射影像报告和病理报告——中自动提取结构化临床信息的技术。EHR 中约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 的临床信息以自由文本形式存在，这些非结构化数据蕴含的丰富临床细节（如症状描述、医生推理、患者社会史）无法通过结构化编码字段捕获。临床 NLP 通过将自由文本转化为可计算的结构化数据，释放了 EHR 中被&quot;锁定&quot;的信息价值，支撑临床研究、质量监测和决策支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"临床文本的独特特征\">临床文本的独特特征</h3><p>临床文本与一般自然语言有显著差异，给 NLP 带来独特挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>NLP 挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高度缩写</td>\n<td>&quot;pt c/o SOB, PE r/o&quot;</td>\n<td>非标准缩写消歧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>否定表达</td>\n<td>&quot;未见肿块&quot;&quot;排除肺栓塞&quot;</td>\n<td>否定检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间表达</td>\n<td>&quot;3天前&quot;&quot;入院第2天&quot;</td>\n<td>时间关系抽取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性</td>\n<td>&quot;考虑&quot;&quot;可能&quot;&quot;不除外&quot;</td>\n<td>确定性评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域术语</td>\n<td>专业医学术语和俚语</td>\n<td>领域特异词表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板化</td>\n<td>大量复制粘贴和模板文本</td>\n<td>信息冗余过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私数据</td>\n<td>嵌入的患者标识信息</td>\n<td>去标识化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"临床-nlp-的核心任务\">临床 NLP 的核心任务</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[临床文本] --&gt; B[去标识化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[命名实体识别 NER]&#10;    A --&gt; D[否定检测]&#10;    A --&gt; E[关系抽取]&#10;    A --&gt; F[时间信息抽取]&#10;    A --&gt; G[文档分类]&#10;    &#10;    C --&gt; H[疾病/症状]&#10;    C --&gt; I[药物/剂量]&#10;    C --&gt; J[解剖部位]&#10;    C --&gt; K[检验结果]&#10;    &#10;    E --&gt; L[药物-适应证]&#10;    E --&gt; M[症状-解剖位置]&#10;    E --&gt; N[治疗-结局]\">graph TD\n    A[临床文本] --&gt; B[去标识化]\n    A --&gt; C[命名实体识别 NER]\n    A --&gt; D[否定检测]\n    A --&gt; E[关系抽取]\n    A --&gt; F[时间信息抽取]\n    A --&gt; G[文档分类]\n    \n    C --&gt; H[疾病/症状]\n    C --&gt; I[药物/剂量]\n    C --&gt; J[解剖部位]\n    C --&gt; K[检验结果]\n    \n    E --&gt; L[药物-适应证]\n    E --&gt; M[症状-解剖位置]\n    E --&gt; N[治疗-结局]</pre><p><strong>命名实体识别</strong>（Named Entity Recognition, NER）：</p>\n<p>从临床文本中识别预定义类型的实体。例如：</p>\n<p>输入：<em>&quot;患者诉*<em>头痛</em></em> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天，伴<strong>恶心</strong>，口服<strong>布洛芬</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400mg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 无明显缓解。&quot;*</p>\n<p>输出：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实体</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>起止位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头痛</td>\n<td>症状</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[3, 5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恶心</td>\n<td>症状</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[9, 11)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布洛芬</td>\n<td>药物</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>14</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>17</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[14, 17)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span>mg</td>\n<td>剂量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>17</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>22</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[17, 22)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">17</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">tid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>22</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[22, 25)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">22</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>否定检测</strong>（Negation Detection）：</p>\n<p>NegEx/ConText 算法使用触发词和作用域规则检测否定、不确定和条件表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>否定状态</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>肯定</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>&quot;发现肺结节&quot;</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>否定</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>&quot;未见肺结节&quot;、&quot;排除肺栓塞&quot;</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>不确定</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>&quot;不除外肺炎&quot;、&quot;考虑肺炎可能&quot;</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>条件</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>&quot;如出现发热需警惕肺炎&quot;</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{否定状态} = \\begin{cases} \\text{肯定} &amp; \\text{&quot;发现肺结节&quot;} \\\\ \\text{否定} &amp; \\text{&quot;未见肺结节&quot;、&quot;排除肺栓塞&quot;} \\\\ \\text{不确定} &amp; \\text{&quot;不除外肺炎&quot;、&quot;考虑肺炎可能&quot;} \\\\ \\text{条件} &amp; \\text{&quot;如出现发热需警惕肺炎&quot;} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否定状态</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">肯定</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否定</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不确定</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">条件</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发现肺结节</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">未见肺结节</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">排除肺栓塞</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不除外肺炎</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">考虑肺炎可能</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">如出现发热需警惕肺炎</span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"传统方法与深度学习方法\">传统方法与深度学习方法</h3><p><strong>传统方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/方法</th>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cTAKES</td>\n<td>UIMA 管线 + 词典匹配 + 规则</td>\n<td>可解释、可定制</td>\n<td>需要大量规则开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MetaMap</td>\n<td>UMLS 概念映射</td>\n<td>覆盖全面</td>\n<td>速度慢、否定处理有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MedLEE</td>\n<td>语法分析 + 语义编码</td>\n<td>深度语义解析</td>\n<td>领域适配成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>深度学习方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>预训练数据</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BioBERT</td>\n<td>BERT-base</td>\n<td>PubMed 摘要</td>\n<td>生物医学文本通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClinicalBERT</td>\n<td>BERT-base</td>\n<td>MIMIC-III 临床文本</td>\n<td>临床文本特异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PubMedBERT</td>\n<td>BERT-base</td>\n<td>PubMed 全文（从头预训练）</td>\n<td>领域特异词表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GatorTron</td>\n<td>Transformer-XL</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>82</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 82</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">82</span></span></span></span></span>B tokens 临床文本</td>\n<td>最大临床语言模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Med-PaLM 2</td>\n<td>PaLM</td>\n<td>医学知识 + 临床数据</td>\n<td>医学问答和推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>基于 Transformer 的 NER 模型通常采用序列标注框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y_t | x_{1:T}) = \\text{softmax}(W \\cdot h_t + b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">softmax</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 BERT 等编码器在位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的隐状态，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为 BIO 标签（B-开始、I-内部、O-外部）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大语言模型在临床-nlp-中的应用\">大语言模型在临床 NLP 中的应用</h3><p>GPT-4 和 Med-PaLM 等大语言模型（LLM）正在改变临床 NLP 的范式：</p>\n<p><strong>临床文档自动生成</strong>：Ambient Clinical Intelligence（如 Nuance DAX）使用 LLM 从医患对话中自动生成结构化临床文档，减轻医生的文档负担（研究显示可节省每位患者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟的文档时间）。</p>\n<p><strong>零样本/少样本信息提取</strong>：LLM 无需标注数据即可完成传统 NER 任务：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Prompt：从以下文本中提取所有药物名称、剂量和频率...</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Prompt：从以下文本中提取所有药物名称、剂量和频率...}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Prompt</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：从以下文本中提取所有药物名称、剂量和频率</span><span class=\"mord\">...</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>初步研究显示 GPT-4 在临床 NER 任务上的零样本性能接近经过微调的 ClinicalBERT（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 \\approx 0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span> vs. <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.90</span></span></span></span></span>），但在复杂关系抽取任务上仍有差距。</p>\n<p><strong>临床推理辅助</strong>：Med-PaLM 2 在美国医学执照考试（USMLE）上达到专家水平（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 85\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85%</span></span></span></span></span> 准确率），展示了 LLM 在临床推理和鉴别诊断中的潜力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"去标识化\">去标识化</h3><p>临床文本去标识化是 NLP 研究的前提。HIPAA 要求移除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 类标识符（PHI）。自动去标识化系统通常组合规则和机器学习方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>去标识化 Pipeline：正则表达式</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>NER 模型</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>日期偏移</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>姓名替换</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{去标识化 Pipeline：正则表达式} + \\text{NER 模型} + \\text{日期偏移} + \\text{姓名替换}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">去标识化</span><span class=\"mord\"> Pipeline</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：正则表达式</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NER </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模型</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日期偏移</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">姓名替换</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>性能基准：在 i2b2 去标识化挑战赛中，最佳系统的总体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.97</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 &gt; 0.97</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.97</span></span></span></span></span>，但对罕见的 PHI 类型（如医疗记录号的非标准格式）仍可能遗漏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准化评测基准\">标准化评测基准</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准</th>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>i2b2/n2c2</td>\n<td>NER、关系抽取、共指消解</td>\n<td>临床笔记（去标识化）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIMIC-III</td>\n<td>多任务（文本 + 结构化）</td>\n<td>ICU 临床文本</td>\n<td>任务相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIOSSES</td>\n<td>语义相似度</td>\n<td>生物医学句子对</td>\n<td>Pearson <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MedNLI</td>\n<td>自然语言推理</td>\n<td>临床句子对</td>\n<td>准确率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RadNLI</td>\n<td>放射报告推理</td>\n<td>放射报告句子对</td>\n<td>准确率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>分析以下临床文本，执行命名实体识别和否定检测：<em>&quot;患者因反复胸闷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周入院。既往有高血压病史 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 年。否认糖尿病、冠心病史。入院心电图未见明显 ST-T 改变。cTnI <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span></span> ng/mL（正常范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.04</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.04</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04</span></span></span></span></span>）。初步排除急性冠脉综合征。&quot;</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 ClinicalBERT（微调方法）和 GPT-4（提示工程方法）在临床 NER 任务中的优缺点。考虑：(a) 性能上限，(b) 标注数据需求，(c) 部署成本，(d) 隐私合规（LLM API 调用是否合规？），(e) 可解释性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个从放射影像报告中自动提取结构化发现的 NLP 系统。目标是从胸部 CT 报告中提取：(a) 肺结节（位置、大小、特征），(b) 胸腔积液（侧别、量），(c) 淋巴结（位置、大小）。说明你选择的技术方案（规则 vs. 深度学习 vs. LLM）和评估策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Ambient Clinical Intelligence 使用 LLM 自动生成临床文档——医生在问诊过程中不需要打字，系统从对话中提取信息并生成格式化的 SOAP 笔记。请讨论：(a) 这种技术对医生倦怠和文档质量的潜在影响，(b) 生成文档的准确性验证流程，(c) 医疗法律责任问题（如果自动生成的文档有误导致医疗纠纷，责任如何分配？）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Savova, G.K. et al. (2010)</strong>：&quot;Mayo Clinical Text Analysis and Knowledge Extraction System (cTAKES)&quot;，JAMIA——cTAKES 系统的权威描述</li>\n<li><strong>Alsentzer, E. et al. (2019)</strong>：&quot;Publicly Available Clinical BERT Embeddings&quot;，NAACL ClinicalNLP——ClinicalBERT 的发布论文</li>\n<li><strong>Singhal, K. et al. (2023)</strong>：&quot;Large Language Models Encode Clinical Knowledge&quot;，Nature——Med-PaLM 在临床推理中的评估</li>\n<li><strong>Johnson, A.E.W. et al. (2016)</strong>：&quot;MIMIC-III, a Freely Accessible Critical Care Database&quot;，Scientific Data——临床 NLP 研究最重要的公开数据集</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>临床 NLP 通过将 EHR 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 的非结构化文本信息转化为可计算的结构化数据，释放了临床数据的巨大价值。从基于规则的 cTAKES 到基于 Transformer 的 ClinicalBERT，再到大语言模型驱动的 Ambient Clinical Intelligence，临床 NLP 的能力正在指数级提升。否定检测、实体消歧和时间推理仍是临床文本的核心技术挑战。去标识化是一切临床 NLP 研究的伦理前提。随着 LLM 在医学领域的快速发展，临床 NLP 正在从信息提取工具演变为临床推理和文档自动化的智能助手。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 临床文本自然语言处理","id":"研究生-生物医学信息学-临床文本自然语言处理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"临床文本的独特特征","id":"临床文本的独特特征"},{"level":3,"text":"临床 NLP 的核心任务","id":"临床-nlp-的核心任务"},{"level":3,"text":"传统方法与深度学习方法","id":"传统方法与深度学习方法"},{"level":3,"text":"大语言模型在临床 NLP 中的应用","id":"大语言模型在临床-nlp-中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"去标识化","id":"去标识化"},{"level":3,"text":"标准化评测基准","id":"标准化评测基准"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 医学影像分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/ai-healthcare/medical-image-analysis"},"next":{"title":"研究生 生物医学信息学 — 健康预测分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/biomedical-informatics/ai-healthcare/predictive-analytics-health"}}